<title>USA: TABLE - Henry Schein Inc Q2 shr $0.28.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Henry Schein Inc Q2 shr $0.28.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.28		    $0.23</p>
<p> Net			  6,810		    4,674</p>
<p> Net sales		263,106		  197,256</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,675		   20,162</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHSended June 28</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.45		    $0.37</p>
<p> Net			 10,836		    7,390</p>
<p> Net sales		503,605		  384,595</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  23,997		   19,957</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company's 1996 figures are restated.</p>
<p>Operating income was $8.8 million compared with $7.2 million.  Merger and integration costs in the 1997 quarter of $1.8 million.</p>
<p>The above net income figures are adjusted for merger and integration costs, and the tax effect on those costs.</p>
<p>Before that adjustment, net income for the quarter was $5.3 million compared to $5.1 million.</p>
<p>The company said increases in sales and earnings reflect internal sales growth of 16 percent and the impact of acquisitions.</p>
